{"id":"n85311-1-9","stage":3,"title":"솔직히 · 坦率地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85311-1-9-1","ko":"내가 어제 산 옷인데, 어때?","zh":"这是我昨天买的衣服，你觉得怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"옷인데,","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷인데","audio":"/audio/a3f81f53cc7086cfb3e0.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe952701c4574cd8bee9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85311-1-9-2","ko":"솔직히 말하면 너한테 안 어울리는 것 같아.","zh":"老实说，我觉得它不太适合你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"솔직히","meaning":"坦率地，老实地","explanation":"솔직히：坦率地，老实地。","readings":[{"term":"솔직히","audio":"/audio/c749bb859d028e0c492c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85311","senseId":"1","lemma":"솔직히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솔직히","audio":"/audio/c749bb859d028e0c492c.mp3"}},{"text":"말하면","meaning":"要说，如果说","explanation":"말하다：要说，如果说；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"말하다","audio":"/audio/f70cb61c1b19f1388e68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62103","senseId":"5","lemma":"말하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말하면","audio":"/audio/9d49bf2977fa6c1e4e7d.mp3"}},{"text":"너한테","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너한테","audio":"/audio/5fa76a3e890a321be5b2.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"어울리는","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어울리는","audio":"/audio/e20b05019b8deca3e66b.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c749bb859d028e0c","term":"솔직히","zh":"坦率地，老实地","audio":"/audio/c749bb859d028e0c492c.mp3","entryId":"85311","definition":"不虚伪地，不做作地。","pronunciation":["솔찌키"]},{"id":"f70cb61c1b19f138","term":"말하다","zh":"要说，如果说","audio":"/audio/f70cb61c1b19f1388e68.mp3","entryId":"62103","definition":"在谈论某种东西之前，先确认或强调的意思。","pronunciation":["말ː하다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId"